              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Pilipo oriŋo bote, ci owinyo en ka kwano buk pa lanebi Icaya, ci openye ni, “In iniaŋ lok ma ikwano-ni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
